ts. Support instructor with classroom logistics to ensure smooth delivery of online instruction. Assist with monitoring class communications and facilitating a positive, organized learning environment. Assist with editing syllabi Qualifications Able to manage Zoom and playing DVDs during undergraduate classes. APA 7 style Does this position meet the definition of Community Service? No How to Apply: Attach a resume Email: [email protected] Position Type: Work Study Department: Undergraduate Studies Program To apply for this job email your details to aerdynast@antioch.edu Back to Job Listings Search CA Disclosures Privacy Policy Resources Terms & Conditions Contact Antioch University is a proud co-founder of the Coalition for the Common Good © Antioch University 2026. All rights reserved. Announcing the New President of Antioch University Learn More"
