 a math tutor for elementary through 9th grade, or performing family literacy activities in a family literacy project that provides services to families with preschool-age children or children who are in elementary school. The purpose is to help children develop reading or math skills. Qualifications Ability to teach reading, math or family literacy as described above Does this position meet the definition of Community Service? Yes How to Apply: Please email Carol Renzelman: [email protected] Email: [email protected] Position Type: Work Study Department: Education To apply for this job email your details to crenzelman@antioch.edu Back to Job Listings Search CA Disclosures Privacy Policy Resources Terms & Conditions Contact Antioch University is a proud co-founder of the Coalition for the Common Good © Antioch University 2026. All rights reserved. Announcing the New President of Antioch University Learn More"
